ed earthen wall [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Praetorium_Agrippinae]; The first fortification also had three moats [SUPPORTED: https://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Praetorium_Agrippinae]; Excavations (digs) at the site found storehouses [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Praetorium_Agrippinae]"}]'::jsonb),
