n_baths_of_Toledo]; Toletum is the Latin (Roman) name of the city of Toledo [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Toledo,_Spain]; The water reached the city by aqueduct [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roman_baths_of_Toledo]"}]'::jsonb),
